# Accepted findings of the image scan. Each entry says why it does not apply and when to look again.
#
# Both advisories list 7.0.9 as the OSS fix and 6.2.20 as Enterprise Support Only.
# Keeping the free 6.2 dependency requires checking that neither affected feature is used:
# there are no XSLT views and no
# Server-Sent Events with view rendering (the only view is a forward to a static page of the
# simulators' panel). Remove these lines with the move to Spring Boot 4. Review by 2026-12-31.
# Sources: https://spring.io/security/cve-2026-47884/ and https://spring.io/security/cve-2026-47890/
# XSLT view path limitation (XsltView)
CVE-2026-47884
# Stream corruption in Server-Sent Events with view rendering
CVE-2026-47890
